{"about_the_game":"When night falls, hordes of undead will invade this land. A young warrior carrying the dragon's legacy follows an ancient oath to confront the encroaching darkness. You are the symbol of hope and light. Your resistance has provoked their wrath, and now they seek to destroy everything you protect.<br>Build by day, fight by night\u2014defend your home with wit and blade!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/2568c3185309088ba3e1deb4653b663d.webp?t=1772255401\" width=615 height=49 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/e121dce56209d0cad8dd771b5e186ff6.poster.avif?t=1772255401\" width=614 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/e121dce56209d0cad8dd771b5e186ff6.webm?t=1772255401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/e121dce56209d0cad8dd771b5e186ff6.mp4?t=1772255401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>By day, you need to construct and upgrade 30 different buildings and units, allocate resources to develop your economy, and deploy soldiers to build an impenetrable defense line.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/92dd9009eed4deac9b1040c722d94630.webp?t=1772255401\" width=615 height=49 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/cbb6590ccca5fa401a788ee7e1e56b3f.poster.avif?t=1772255401\" width=614 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/ex